  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dredging course Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch dredging experts offer a course to assist Myanmar decision-makers in developing environmentally sustainable dredging projects. The course aims to contribute to a good business climate and entrepreneurship in the water and related sectors.Three purposes contribute to this overall goal:&#x2022;	Capacity building to achieve better knowledge and understanding of the requirements of a dredging project, including the financial prospects.&#x2022;	Increasing the ability to prepare better and more fair tenders for upcoming dredging projects.&#x2022;	Positioning of The Netherlands as a reliable partner for knowledge and integrated approach to dredging.</narrative>
  </description>
